---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { COMPANY_INFO } from '@/lib/constants';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`API & Service Documentation | ${COMPANY_INFO.brand_name}`}
  description="API catalog, sitemap endpoints, and agent discovery documentation for Growth Indonesia Corporate Outbound & Event Management."
  canonical="https://growthindonesia.my.id/docs/api"
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-navy text-white px-4 py-28 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <div>
        <a
          href="/"
          class="text-brand hover:text-white text-sm font-semibold transition-colors mb-4 inline-block"
        >
          &larr; Kembali ke Beranda
        </a>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-display text-white">
          Dokumentasi API &amp; Penemuan Agen
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-navy-muted text-base">
          Katalog agen (RFC 9727) dan referensi endpoint terbuka Growth Indonesia untuk sistem indeksasi dan asisten AI.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-navy-border space-y-4 overflow-hidden">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Sumber Daya Penemuan Standar</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border sm:col-span-2 min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">LLMs.txt &amp; Official Pricing Reference</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1 max-w-[70ch]">
              Dokumen referensi resmi berbasis teks dan Markdown untuk penemuan layanan, lokasi venue, serta struktur harga paket korporat.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <a href="/llms.txt" class="text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline">/llms.txt</a>
              <a href="/pricing.md" class="text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline">/pricing.md</a>
              <a href="/api/markdown?path=/" class="text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline">/api/markdown</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border sm:col-span-2 min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Client WebMCP Tools API</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1 max-w-[70ch]">
              Implementasi WebMCP (W3C Web Machine Learning CG) melalui <code class="text-white font-mono break-all">navigator.modelContext.provideContext()</code> menyediakan instrumen browser langsung untuk agen AI (kalkulator anggaran, pencarian layanan, cakupan kota, dan konsultasi WhatsApp).
            </p>
            <span class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-mono text-brand break-all">
              Client API: navigator.modelContext.provideContext()
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">A2A Agent Card</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1">Kartu agen Agent-to-Agent (A2A) untuk penemuan keahlian dan endpoint Markdown.</p>
            <a href="/.well-known/agent-card.json" class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline break-all">
              /.well-known/agent-card.json
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">MCP Server Card</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1">Katalog penemuan Model Context Protocol (MCP) dan endpoint Markdown.</p>
            <a href="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline break-all">
              /.well-known/mcp/server-card.json
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">API Catalog Endpoint</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1">Spesifikasi JSON API Catalog sesuai standar RFC 9727.</p>
            <a href="/.well-known/api-catalog" class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline break-all">
              /.well-known/api-catalog
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">XML Sitemap</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1">Indeks tautan sitemap untuk penjelajahan halaman layanan dan kota.</p>
            <a href="/sitemap.xml" class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline break-all">
              /sitemap.xml
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-navy p-5 rounded-xl border border-navy-border sm:col-span-2 min-w-0">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">DNS for AI Discovery (RFC 9460 &amp; DNS-AID)</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted mt-1 max-w-[70ch]">
              Katalog dan konfigurasi DNS ServiceMode SVCB/HTTPS records untuk penemuan agen berbasis DNS.
            </p>
            <a href="/.well-known/dns-aid" class="mt-3 inline-block text-xs font-mono text-brand hover:underline break-all">
              /.well-known/dns-aid
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-navy-2 border border-navy-border rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Markdown for Agents (Content Negotiation)</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-navy-muted max-w-[70ch]">
          Situs ini mendukung negosiasi konten Markdown untuk AI Agent. Setiap permintaan dengan header <code class="text-white font-mono">Accept: text/markdown</code> akan menerima konten berformat Markdown murni, header <code class="text-white font-mono">Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8</code>, dan estimasi <code class="text-white font-mono">x-markdown-tokens</code>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
